      "title": "If in doubt, delete the uv.lock file",
      "url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/1/delete-uv-lock-first/",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-01T23:24:22.000Z",
      "snippet": " <p>I've been getting the occasional confusing Python dependency error since switching over to Python 3.15 and the rule I'm having to remember is:</p> <p><strong>If in doubt, delete the uv.lock file</strong></p> <p>Most of my projects are libraries which don't include a <code>uv.lock</code> file, since it's rude for a library dependency to lock versions for anything else that uses it.</p> <p>Running <code>uv run pytest</code> etc tends to leave <code>uv.lock</code> files lying around, which are ",
